Error [jet.BlockAfterCall]: Trailing blocks are gone — pass code with `fn() { … }`
  --> tests/ui/marker_wrong_at_plane.jet:2:35
    |
  2 |     @Unsafe("raw pointer access") {
    |                                   ^
 Why: A bare `{ }` after a call used to fill one last zero-parameter function argument; that sugar is retired
 Fix: Write `@Unsafe(…, fn() { … })` — put the block inside the parentheses as `fn() { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0335
